            "title": "30-Day Price Guarantee",
            "content": "<p>If the price of your purchase changes <strong>within 30 days</strong> of your order, resulting in you paying more or missing out on a gift, please contact us. We will <strong>refund the price difference</strong> or send the complimentary gift.</p><p>*Only <strong>for orders starting after 24th, June, 2025</strong></p>",
