            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Spacious Running Area",
            "content": "<p>With a <strong>15.2\" x 36.8\" deck</strong> and <strong>265 lbs capacity</strong>, this walking pad offers plenty of space to walk <strong>comfortably and safely</strong>. The <strong>1–4 mph speed range</strong> makes it perfect for everything from <strong>light strolls to steady walks</strong>, whether you're staying active at work or recovering at home.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "background": "#f0f0f0",
