            "media_position": "start",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Joint-Friendly Shock Absorption Deck",
            "content": "<p>The <strong>5-layer running belt</strong> is designed to <strong>reduce impact on your knees and joints</strong>, providing a <strong>smooth, cushioned walking experience</strong>. Whether you're taking a slow stroll or increasing your pace, the <strong>shock-absorbing deck</strong> helps protect your knees, making every step <strong>gentler and more comfortable</strong>.</p>",
